  abilityDesc: 28 combo massive Dark attack on all foes (enormously boosts own critical
    hit rate, damage relative to remaining HP), 5 combo massive Fire, Thunder, Light,
    Dark attack on single foe, enormously boosts Atk, Def relative to max HP for
    3 turns, enormously boosts Spark damage for 3 turns, enormous 3 turn Atk, Def
    reduction & damage taken enormously restores HP for 3 turns
